        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201904",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Treasure Hoarders",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220190401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220190401": {
            "id": "220190401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "...And Andou and Amano are taking the culprit back to the police station as we speak, Sango.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190402"
            ]
          },
          "220190402": {
            "id": "220190402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I see. Then it's settled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190403"
            ]
          },
          "220190403": {
            "id": "220190403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Traveler, thank you for your help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190406"
            ]
          },
          "220190406": {
            "id": "220190406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "It's normal to feel that way. After all, it was Amano and Andou who took the criminal away. Why don't you take your pay? It'll help all this feel more real."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201905",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ryuuji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220190301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220190301": {
            "id": "220190301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Now we've caught him red-handed. Thanks for the help, Ryuuji, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190302"
            ]
          },
          "220190302": {
            "id": "220190302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Amano and I will take these Treasure Hoarders back to the police station. We'll handle the rest of the case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190303"
            ]
          },
          "220190303": {
            "id": "220190303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Amano",
            "text": "It's amazing how Sango could figure out the details of the case so accurately...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190304"
            ]
          },
          "220190304": {
            "id": "220190304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Well, it is Sango. A case like this is no big deal to her, no doubt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190305"
            ]
          },
          "220190305": {
            "id": "220190305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Andou",
            "text": "Ryuuji, we'll head back to the police station first. We'll pay you a visit when we're done with this guy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190306"
            ]
          },
          "220190306": {
            "id": "220190306",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "My pleasure. Take care.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190307"
            ]
          },
          "220190307": {
            "id": "220190307",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Traveler, let's go back and report to Sango."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201906",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201906",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220190601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220190601": {
            "id": "220190601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "If you go now, you should be able to catch him red-handed. I'll wait here for your good news.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190602"
            ]
          },
          "220190602": {
            "id": "220190602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Is there anything else you want to say, Traveler?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190604",
              "220190608"
            ]
          },
          "220190604": {
            "id": "220190604",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "This case is pretty uninteresting: it has a boring perpetrator, and the methods lack sophistication.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190605"
            ]
          },
          "220190605": {
            "id": "220190605",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "If I had to rate this case... it's a total snore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190606"
            ]
          },
          "220190606": {
            "id": "220190606",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But again, it's a crime, so it's good that it gets dealt with."
          },
          "220190608": {
            "id": "220190608",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "My part is done, so I'll stay out of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190609"
            ]
          },
          "220190609": {
            "id": "220190609",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Besides, with my fighting skills and physique, I could be taken hostage by the culprit, which he could then use to get what he wants. That would be the worst.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220190610"
            ]
          },
          "220190610": {
            "id": "220190610",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I know my limits, so I'll leave it to you to deal with him."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}